:: MP Job Cafe Encounter 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
《海风日报》的记者把三只空杯在吧台上一字排开。他说离截稿只剩一刻钟，三杯必须各不相同：一杯深烘黑咖啡、一杯肉桂摩卡、一杯双份奶泡拿铁。靠窗二桌的退休领航员温特斯照例坐着，黑咖啡里要撒一撮盐，等得不耐烦就用杯垫在桌沿敲两下。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在烘豆机后头腾不出手，只朝你抬了抬下巴。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc2">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link "三壶并火分萃 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把三只壶同时架上火，深烘那壶守着时间，摩卡的肉桂棒和可可膏隔水化开，奶泡另用一只小壶打。三杯并排推过去时，颜色从深到浅分得清清楚楚，记者逐杯抿过，在稿纸上写了两行，把加急稿酬按在吧台上。<span class="green">三杯都赶在截稿前交了出去。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 800>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你顾着摩卡的奶泡，深烘那壶在火上多坐了半分钟，苦味压过了头，第三杯的奶泡也塌了。记者看了看表，把本子塞回口袋，说改天再来。温特斯的黑咖啡也凉在窗边。<span class="red">三杯没能一起交出去。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[三壶并火分萃 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "三壶并火分萃">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<link "买糕稳住常客 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc2">>
你从围裙口袋里数出两枚银币，让糕点柜后的小工切一碟肉桂卷送到窗边，又笑着告诉温特斯黑咖啡稍等片刻。老领航员用叉子敲了敲碟沿，没再催。你腾出手把三只保温壶里的底咖分别加热、重新打奶泡，赶在记者合上本子前把三杯并排推过去。<span class="green">窗边和吧台都安静了下来。</span>
<<money -200>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买糕稳住常客 (0:04)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "照熟客簿配单 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc2">>
你翻开吧台下的熟客簿，先照温特斯的旧单送上一杯撒盐黑咖啡。老领航员端起杯子，敲垫的手停在半空。你按簿子上记的偏好把深烘、摩卡和拿铁分壶配好，三杯的颜色和香气各不相同。记者终于坐稳，稿纸翻得飞快。<span class="green">这一单没再出岔子。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 350>><</if>>
<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">照熟客簿配单 (0:05)（还不熟悉熟客）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Job Cafe Encounter 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
雨从屋檐的裂口倒灌进来，靠窗二桌正上方洇开一片深色水痕，一滴一滴落进温特斯那杯撒了盐的黑咖啡里。老领航员皱着眉，用杯垫在桌沿敲了两下。后厨同时探出头来：河湾农场的面粉车还堵在雨里，午市的司康只剩半袋。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把两条干布塞进你怀里，又指了指天花板。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc3">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<link "爬梁铺油布 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你踩着吧台边的矮凳翻上横梁，把油布四角压在瓦条下，又用麻绳在漏水最急的地方兜了一道导水的斜槽。雨水顺着布角淌到后墙，窗边二桌终于不再落水。你跳下来时，厨房学徒也把面粉车接进了后门。<span class="green">屋顶和后厨都撑住了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_6_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 600>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	横梁上全是湿滑的苔，你脚下一滑，膝盖磕在瓦条上，油布只铺开一半就垂了下来。水珠仍往窗边落，温特斯把杯子挪开，脸色不太好看。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在下面喊你先下来，面粉车也还堵在雨里。<span class="red">这一趟白爬了。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[爬梁铺油布 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "爬梁铺油布">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "借鱼档油布 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
你想起鱼档今早送冰筐时留下的那张柏油布还搭在后门。你把它拖进来盖在漏水处，四角用鱼篓压住，水线立刻改道；剩下的半幅正好裹住后厨那袋快受潮的面粉。鱼档的伙计在雨里喊你改天补两杯咖啡就行。<span class="green">漏水和面粉都暂时有了着落。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_7_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 500>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">借鱼档油布 (0:05)（鱼档还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link "先挪常客茶桌 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
你顺着水痕往上看，发现漏点正好在温特斯头顶那盏吊灯上方。你把二桌往干爽的里侧挪开半步，又把铜桶踢到滴水线下接住，顺手替他换了杯没落进雨水的黑咖啡。老领航员用杯垫敲了两下，这回是满意的意思。<span class="teal">窗边总算没再淋着人。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_8_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 250>><<link "掏钱买急面 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
你数出两枚银币和一把铜板，托同一条街上面包房的送货学徒先匀一袋磨好的白面过来。学徒披着雨布跑了两趟，后厨的司康总算接上了。你回身把湿透的桌布换掉，又拿干布把窗台擦了一遍。<span class="teal">午市的面点没有断档。</span>
<<money -250>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_9_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 560>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">掏钱买急面 (0:04)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Job Cafe Encounter 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
多瑙河街来的两位贵妇坐在包厢侧桌，点了店里最贵的深烘手冲，还指名要配老乐手埃利奥特常点的那款热奶泡。可你刚摇动黄铜磨豆机，齿盘里就传出一声刺耳的咔哒声——生豆袋底混进了一颗细白石英子，把锥齿死死咬住。靠窗二桌的退休领航员温特斯抬起眼皮看了看表，报社记者林赛也停下了钢笔。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc4">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<link "拆盘挑出碎石 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你拧松磨豆机顶部的铜翼螺母，借着吧台灯光用细竹签一拨，那颗卡在锥齿缝里的石英子便弹进掌心。齿盘重新归位，磨出的深烘豆粉粗细均匀，热气裹着焦糖香漫过包厢。贵妇抿了一口，在银托盘里留下一枚厚实的赏钱。<span class="green">磨豆机毫发无损，手冲按时上桌。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_4a_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 880>><</if>>
	<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_1 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_1 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	螺母拧得太急，弹簧垫片滑落进豆仓，你摸索了半晌才装回去，冲出的咖啡已经失了热气。贵妇放下杯子没给小费。<span class="red">你在吧台后急出了一额薄汗。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拆盘挑出碎石 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拆盘挑出碎石">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 7200 or ($athletics or 0) gte 230>><<link "铜臼手捣细粉 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc4">>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 8000 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你取下后厨捣香料的厚壁黄铜臼，手腕悬空稳稳发力，百来下就把深烘豆捣成粗细合度的碎粉，再用细铜筛筛去浮皮。手捣出的咖啡油脂反而格外醇厚，温特斯闻着香气也多点了一杯。<span class="green">手捣深烘赢得了满堂喝彩。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_4a_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 560>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -1>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_1 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_1 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	铜杵捣得轻重不匀，粗粒和细粉混在一处，滤布一下就被细粉堵住，咖啡滴得又慢又涩。<span class="red">小臂酸麻不说，这壶也没能卖出好价。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铜臼手捣细粉 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "铜臼手捣细粉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：7200 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<if ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 6>><<link "奉面包房茶点 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc4">>
你先端上石炉面包房今早特供的蜂蜜杏仁脆饼，笑着向贵妇说明店里正在更换细磨滤网，请她们先尝热茶点。酥脆的杏仁香立刻引开了她们的注意，等她们吃完半碟，你已用备用小磨盘把咖啡萃好送上。<span class="green">面包房的茶点替吧台解了围。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_4a_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 620>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">奉面包房茶点 (0:04)（面包房还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Job Cafe Encounter 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
午后海风骤紧，露台遮阳伞的挂钩晃了一下，猛灌进来的横风把三号桌边的方糖盅与奶油碟吹翻。半勺打发鲜奶油溅在老乐手埃利奥特刚写好的五线谱草稿与报社记者林赛的速写簿上，两人同时站起身来。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc5">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "薄刃刮净奶油 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc5">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 270 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你取来抹黄油的薄银刀，趁鲜奶油还没渗进厚画纸纤维，贴着纸面斜挑而起，再用微温的干亚麻巾背面轻轻吸走余脂。五线谱上的墨迹一笔没花，埃利奥特和林赛对视一眼，双双在杯垫下压了赏钱。<span class="green">乐谱与速写本都干干净净地救了回来。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_5a_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 660>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_2 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_2 or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_3 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	你下刀稍重，奶油反而被抹开了一片油印，半页音符变得模糊不清。老乐手叹了口气，把草稿折起来塞回琴盒。<span class="red">露台的气氛一时有些冷清。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[薄刃刮净奶油 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "薄刃刮净奶油">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 230 or ($english or 0) gte 230>><<link "奉冰咖赔礼 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc5">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你请两人移步内厅靠窗的干爽卡座，亲手送上两杯加了薄荷叶的冰镇特调，又替他们取来店内备用的干爽信笺重新誊抄。林赛笑着说这桩海风小插曲正好写进晚报副刊，临走照单多付了一份茶资。<span class="green">几句话便把露台的风波化成了趣谈。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_5a_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 510>><</if>>
	<<seductionskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_3 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	你端着冰咖过去时，埃利奥特正心疼那页湿谱子，没心思闲聊，只挥手让你先把地上的碎瓷片扫走。<span class="red">赔礼的话没能说到点子上。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[奉冰咖赔礼 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "奉冰咖赔礼">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "挪木屏挡海风 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc5">>
你先把露台迎风处的藤编屏风拉过来扣死插销，挡住直灌的横风，再蹲下身把散落的方糖和奶油碟收拾干净。老乐手自己用吸墨纸压干了谱面，朝你点了点头。<span class="teal">风口堵住了，露台恢复了秩序。</span>
